From a8d7f528006f3c139b9ba497ca901b1eede32178 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 10:49:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: the remaining swept pages take their pre-rebase edits by
 three-way merge

The page fix (dad0eb048eb) re-merged only pages whose diff carried a "reaper"
marker; the v2.3.3 de-cloud edits carry none, so Main_GameServer_Content.asp
came back with upstream's ASUS-CDN request and reaper_verify's de-cloud gate
caught it. Every other page the sweep touched that differs from the old base is
now the three-way merge of our copy onto upstream's text too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
